From e6356d9932adfe54fc7ccd8c5f24a44b43ef58f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Faber <72028327+Jonohas@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:02:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] Shell: add a Duo stretch mode to the fullscreen unfold
 animator

Duo squeezes fullscreen and home tasks horizontally to the cover
screen's width and widens them to full with unfold progress. In Stock
the unfold transition handler no longer claims the display change,
because no progress arrives and the claim would hold the switch for
five seconds. SystemUI binds the style; without it Shell keeps AOSP
behaviour.
